          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਜ਼ੁਕਾਮ — zukām — \"a head cold\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਮੈਨੂੰ ਜ਼ੁਕਾਮ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੈਂ ਅੱਜ ਘਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਹਾਂ। mainū̃ zukām hai ate maiṁ ajj ghar vich hāṁ. I have a cold, and I am at home today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਜ਼ੁਕਾਮ (zukām) is a loan, usually traced through Persian to Arabic zukām, \"a cold, catarrh\"."
            }
          ]
        },
